8	 * and only falls back to the fixed city-to-region table when the postcode is absent or in
9	 * no known range. Kept out of {@link OwnerMapper} so MapStruct does not mistake it for a
10	 * {@code String -> String} mapping method and apply it to every string property.
11	 */
